{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t2005年執勤時遇襲而癱瘓的高級警員朱振國，上月離世。警務處為朱振國舉行警隊最高榮譽喪禮，行政長官李家超等出席。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n靈車其後駛至長沙灣分區警署舉行道別儀式，朱振國的靈柩其後安葬浩園。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.886451+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:24:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T23:58:55.574459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:34.795720+00:00","content_hash":"06478076c503e2b8e30c67192ff57fc08f7ba75cbef76ce65b38a91afaeb4475","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}